---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
const serverFacts = 'https://github.com/mykcs/zju-server/blob/main/docs/server-facts.md';
const experimentRepo = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment';
---
<AppLayout title="Experiment devices and servers" description="The current OpenEvo experiment uses a 5×RTX5090 allocation; server inventory records 8 visible RTX5090 GPUs. RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 is a historical experiment platform." locale="en">
  <div class="shell editorial-page lab-current-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="section-kicker">Experiment environment · 2026-08-14</span>
      <h1>Experiment devices and servers</h1>
      <p class="lede">The active OpenEvo × WebShop scientific experiment is maintained in <code>openevo-experiment</code> and currently has a <strong>5×RTX5090</strong> allocation. RTX6 with 4×RTX3090 remains only as historical experiment and migration evidence.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="current-server-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">Current</span><h2 id="current-server-title">OpenEvo experiment server</h2></div></div>
      <dl class="lab-facts">
        <div><dt>Experiment allocation</dt><dd>5× NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Visible server inventory</dt><dd>8× NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Experiment repository</dt><dd><code>mykcs/openevo-experiment</code></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Current phase</dt><dd>Phase H0 · Natural Success Search</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="muted">Eight visible GPUs is a server-inventory fact; it does not mean every experiment uses all eight. This page shows the current five-GPU experiment allocation.</p>
      <div class="lab-links"><a class="button button-secondary" href={serverFacts} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Server facts ↗</a><a class="button button-secondary" href={experimentRepo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Experiment repo ↗</a><a class="button button-primary" href={localePath('en','/research/seed-openevo/results/')}>Experiment results →</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="history-server-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">Historical</span><h2 id="history-server-title">RTX6 · 4×RTX3090</h2></div></div>
      <p>RTX6 previously handled WebShop / ALFWorld bring-up, early OpenEvo parameter experiments, and extensive engineering debugging. Its logs, failure traces, and migration evidence remain in <code>seed3090</code> and historical run records, but it no longer represents current experiment hardware.</p>
      <div class="history-grid"><article><strong>seed3090</strong><span>RTX6 engineering and early experiment archive</span></article><article><strong>openevo-webshop</strong><span>WebShop × SD-LoRA migration repository</span></article><article><strong>openevo-experiment</strong><span>Current formal experimental source of truth</span></article></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="paths-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">Entry points</span><h2 id="paths-title">Experiment pages</h2></div></div>
      <div class="history-grid"><a href={localePath('en','/guide/openevo-webshop-alfworld/')}><strong>Reproduction guide</strong><span>Current server, WebShop contract, and Phase H0</span></a><a href={localePath('en','/research/seed-openevo/experiment/')}><strong>Experiment entry</strong><span>OpenEvo × WebShop data flow</span></a><a href={localePath('en','/research/seed-openevo/results/')}><strong>Experiment results</strong><span>Phase D–F, Phase G, and historical evidence</span></a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</AppLayout>

<style>
.lab-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.65rem;margin:0}.lab-facts div{padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px}.lab-facts dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem}.lab-facts dd{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:750}.lab-links{display:flex;gap:.55rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}.history-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem}.history-grid article,.history-grid>a{padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.history-grid strong,.history-grid span{display:block}.history-grid span{margin-top:.35rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.45}.section>p{max-width:78ch;line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:700px){.lab-facts,.history-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
